<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Ardagh half year pre-tax profit 3.3 mln punt.</title>
<headline>Ardagh half year pre-tax profit 3.3 mln punt.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>26 weeks to December 24, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million punts unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		7.98		   vs 7.25</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 1.155		   vs 1.050</p>
<p> Pretax		     3.31		   vs 2.90</p>
<p> Turnover		   20.32		  vs 19.92</p>
<p>NOTE - Ardagh Plc is an Irish-based glass and plastics manufacturer.</p>
